# The mix across the world, captured (--audio-out) and measured by audio_mix_world_check:
# segments named by `set mark` (a name starting with ~ is settling, not measured): the title,
# the home by day and night in each season, the three cities at market hours, evening and the
# small hours and on a festival, a harbour, two towns, a road, a mountain pass, the open sea,
# rain and snow in three climates, the Saturnalia in the rain (everything at once), fast travel
# between each pair of cities, the map, the pause menu and a mute and unmute.
wait 20
set mark title
wait 240
set mark ~
click ui:menu:continue
wait 8
type Ear
click ui:menu:create
wait 10
click ui:menu:skip_tour
wait 10
key home
set season spring
set clock day
set mark ~
wait 20
fast 22
set mark home.spring.day
fast 5
set clock night
set mark ~
wait 20
fast 22
set mark home.spring.night
fast 5
